  "info": {
    "title": "Emergency department: staffing game",
    "category": "Games",
    "description": "A staffing game built on ed_patient_agents: patients run the same Stable -> Deteriorating -> Critical statechart through triage and a Doctor queue ranked by entity.agent.acuity. Two controls let a player staff Doctor (1-4) and Nurse (1-3) up or down mid-run; every 8 hours a Policy-mode DECIDE ('divert') asks whether to divert ambulances, which turns away 60% of new arrivals until reviewed again. In the results, read the doctor queue, doctor utilisation, waiting against critical patients, the acuity mix and the diverted count.",
    "author": "Naga example"
  },
